  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1708602713_3044375_67a9a66bb9f2797d3b438e742fbe5dd0.png",
  "description": "<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Brand Introduction:</span></h4>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Welcome to <strong>Unleash Your Brain Potential</strong>, where we specialize in transformative brainwave music designed to enhance mental well-being, creativity, and focus. Our mission is to help individuals unlock their full cognitive capabilities and achieve personal growth through the power of sound.</span></p>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Product Description:</span></h4>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Our flagship product, the Ultimate BrainWave Music Set, features meticulously crafted tracks across Alpha, Beta, and Theta wave frequencies. Each set is tailored to promote specific mental states, from deep relaxation and creative stimulation to improved concentration and memory retention.</span></p>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Unique Selling Point (USP):</span></h4>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">What sets us apart is our commitment to quality and scientific research. Our brainwave music isn't just soothing sounds; it's a tool for real mental enhancement. With tracks optimized for various daily activities, users experience tangible benefits, including stress reduction, enhanced productivity, and deeper sleep.</span></p>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Payment Terms:</span></h4>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Affiliates receive a competitive commission of 33% on every sale made through their unique referral link. Payments are processed monthly via PayPal, ensuring timely and secure compensation for your promotional efforts.</span></p>\r\n<h4 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Other Information:</span></h4>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Joining our affiliate program gives you access to a range of resources, including promotional materials, real-time tracking tools, and dedicated support. Our team is here to help you succeed and grow with us.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Together, let's spread the power of brainwave music and help people worldwide achieve their true potential.</span></p>",
